# Color0-Color7 (normal) and Intense variants + Foreground corrected
# 2026-09-25 to the exact hex of [variants.sage.ansi] in
# tokens/indigo-glass.tokens.toml (oklch_to_hex, tokens/codegen.py) — this
# file is hand-kept (codegen.py never writes share/konsole/*), and several
# ANSI slots had drifted: Color0/Color0Intense were far too dark to read as
# black/bright-black, and Color4/Color5/Color6 carried unrelated colours
# (accent_hi, accent_alt, a generic cyan) instead of the ANSI blue/magenta/
# cyan hues, which breaks ls/git/diff colour-coding. See simulator
# /desktop/konsole/ for the per-slot check against the token file.
